<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="sheet-tag">SHEET NO. 001 — PORTFOLIO OVERVIEW</span>
      <h1>Mechanical engineer.<br><span>Robotics &amp; automation.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">I design, build, and test electromechanical systems — from actuated linkages to autonomous ground vehicles — taking projects from CAD to working hardware.</p>
      <div class="hero-specs">
        <div class="spec"><span class="num">6</span><span class="label">Projects shipped</span></div>
