        <h3>Autonomous line-following rover</h3>
        <p class="desc">Built a two-wheel differential-drive rover with a PID-based line-following controller and obstacle detection, from chassis design through firmware.</p>
        <div class="project-stats">
          <div class="stat"><span class="num">1.4 m/s</span><span class="label">Top speed</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><span class="num">50 Hz</span><span class="label">Control loop</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">Arduino</span>
          <span class="tag">PID Control</span>
          <span class="tag">Sheet Metal</span>
          <span class="tag">C++</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href="#">GitHub repo</a>
          <a href="#">Demo video</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Project 3 -->
    <article class="project-sheet">
      <div class="project-media">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 200">
          <path d="M60,150 L60,90 L130,50 L200,90 L200,150"/>
          <line class="accent" x1="60" y1="150" x2="200" y2="150"/>
